WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.016 --> 00:00:02.720
- All right, everybody,
let's close this story

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:05.520
sure to make you feel warm
and fuzzy this holiday season,

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:06.641
this is what I'm liking.

00:00:06.641 --> 00:00:09.727
(upbeat music)
(audience cheering)

00:00:09.727 --> 00:00:11.670
So when a North Carolina 7-year-old

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:14.430
told her dad she wanted
to start a coffee company,

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:16.500
he went all in to help her out.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.260
Now, two years later, she
is one of the youngest CEOs

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:20.400
I have ever heard of.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.170
She has a thriving coffee shop

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:25.170
and an online business
selling home roasted beans

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:27.750
and candles and soap
made from coffee grounds,

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.120
all that, and she and
her dad are giving back

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:31.920
to the community, which is incredible.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.270
We have her on the line right now

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:36.660
along with her father watching on WYFF4.

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:38.566
What's up Charlie and TJ?

00:00:38.566 --> 00:00:42.083
(audience cheering)
- Hey, Kelly!

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:45.510
- Hello, so Charlie,
what's it like being CEO?

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:47.550
You're so young.
- I love it

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:49.500
because everybody supports me

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.100
and whenever me and dad do,
it's never one single person.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.890
Everything we do, we work together to do.

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:57.990
- Aw, that's incredibly
cool for your family.

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:01.170
So TJ, what is it like
working with her like this?

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:03.660
- I've never seen anything into comparison

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:05.880
of watching the people that come in

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:08.550
and support her within this
town and this community.

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:10.140
It's absolutely amazing.

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:13.380
It's literally the epitome
of the perfection of life

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:15.000
of being a dad.
- Aw!

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.513
Oh my gosh and also, you're
killing me, I'm gonna cry.

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:21.390
Also, what I think is
really cool is you're

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:22.770
you're having this
beautiful family moment,

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:25.080
but you're giving back to
the community as well, right?

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:28.440
- Yeah, our goal this year is
to help over a thousand kids

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:29.550
within the community.

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:31.230
So we're taking a portion of our proceeds

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:34.290
Charlie came up with to
give at least a portion

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:36.570
of the coffee that we saw
online and within our stores

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:38.820
to help support these kids
so that way we can make sure

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:40.200
that they get toys this year.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.360
- Because it's just fair for kids

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:44.640
not to get at least one toy.

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:46.740
- That's right and I've
been homeless before

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:48.150
and been through some pretty tough times

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:49.470
and I know what it's like to struggle

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:50.700
and we wanna make sure that those kids

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:52.290
don't have that problem this year.

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:53.242
- Oh, wow!

00:01:53.242 --> 00:01:55.698
What a beautiful family!

00:01:55.698 --> 00:01:57.690
Thank you, Charlie, Thank you TJ,

00:01:57.690 --> 00:01:59.613
I'm liking your posts right now.

00:01:59.613 --> 00:02:01.530
(bell dinging)
- Yes ma'am. Thank you.

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:02.880
- All right, well that's not all.

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:04.470
You're cute, little,
"Yes ma'am," I like it.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:06.240
Our season long partner Pilot Pen,

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:08.670
makers of G2, the go-to pen
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:11.250
want to honor truly unstoppable people

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:12.420
just like the two of you.

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:13.710
